{"1139880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chapeau", "steam_appid": 1139880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1277540], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.webm?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.mp4?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The spirit of local co-op is alive, and it’s haunting hilarious headwear! Go Head to Head with your friends in frantic Versus modes or try working together in Cap-tivating co-op. You can even fly solo in Challenge mode to unlock new hats and maps!<br><br>Bounce, float and zoom through the air and land on people’s heads to score points. Use jetpacks, dogs, shields...anything you can do to get a-Head of the competition and master the playstyle of each headpiece! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.webm?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.mp4?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find your perfect fit with different hats to match both your style and your playstyle<br></li><li>Play with up to 4 players in split-screen or against bots<br></li><li>Or play online against your friends via Steam Remote Play (they don’t even need to own the game!)<br></li><li>Use items like jetpacks, dogs or even comets to sabotage your opponents and stay a step ahead in the ever-changing dynamic playfields<br></li><li>Compete in the modes The Floor is Lava, Color Craze and Where is Wilhelm <br></li><li>Test your skills in Challenge Mode to unlock a host of new hats &amp; maps! <br></li><li>Unlock and collect all the funny hats and skins</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/7a149c841b2aa64ced8f2a11414dd93c.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/7a149c841b2aa64ced8f2a11414dd93c.webm?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/7a149c841b2aa64ced8f2a11414dd93c.mp4?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.webm?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/72b447f7b7499af37e07f555984ea9a0.mp4?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The spirit of local co-op is alive, and it’s haunting hilarious headwear! Go Head to Head with your friends in frantic Versus modes or try working together in Cap-tivating co-op. You can even fly solo in Challenge mode to unlock new hats and maps!<br><br>Bounce, float and zoom through the air and land on people’s heads to score points. Use jetpacks, dogs, shields...anything you can do to get a-Head of the competition and master the playstyle of each headpiece! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.webm?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/36cd1bca5dbf86851b7227dc05108a35.mp4?t=1654867027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find your perfect fit with different hats to match both your style and your playstyle<br></li><li>Play with up to 4 players in split-screen or against bots<br></li><li>Or play online against your friends via Steam Remote Play (they don’t even need to own the game!)<br></li><li>Use items like jetpacks, dogs or even comets to sabotage your opponents and stay a step ahead in the ever-changing dynamic playfields<br></li><li>Compete in the modes The Floor is Lava, Color Craze and Where is Wilhelm <br></li><li>Test your skills in Challenge Mode to unlock a host of new hats &amp; maps! <br></li><li>Unlock and collect all the funny hats and skins</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/extras/7a149c841b2aa64ced8f2a11414dd93c.poster.avif?t=1654867027\" width=620 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139880/